<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Prayer Requests</title>

<link
href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
rel="stylesheet"
>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

body{
background:
linear-gradient(
135deg,
#12001f,
#2c003e,
#4b006e
);

color:white;
padding:28px;
min-height:100vh;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* TOP BAR */
/* ===================================== */

.top-bar{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
margin-bottom:28px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:15px;
}

.page-title{
font-size:34px;
font-weight:700;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* BUTTONS */
/* ===================================== */

.back-btn,
.submit-btn,
.nav-btn{

padding:10px 16px;

border-radius:12px;

text-decoration:none;

font-weight:600;

font-size:14px;

transition:0.3s;

border:none;

cursor:pointer;

display:inline-block;
}

.back-btn{
background:#ffcc00;
color:black;
}

.submit-btn{
background:#00d4ff;
color:black;
}

.nav-btn{
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
color:white;
}

.back-btn:hover,
.submit-btn:hover,
.nav-btn:hover{
background:white;
color:black;
transform:translateY(-2px);
}

/* ===================================== */
/* PRAYER NAVIGATION */
/* ===================================== */

.prayer-nav{
display:flex;
gap:12px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
margin-bottom:24px;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* FORM BOX */
/* ===================================== */

.form-box{

max-width:900px;

margin:auto;

background:
rgba(255,255,255,0.10);

padding:28px;

border-radius:24px;

backdrop-filter:blur(10px);

box-shadow:
0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

/* ===================================== */
/* DESCRIPTION */
/* ===================================== */

.form-description{
font-size:15px;
line-height:1.7;
opacity:0.9;
margin-bottom:24px;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* GUIDELINES */
/* ===================================== */

.guidelines{

background:
rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

padding:18px;

border-radius:18px;

margin-bottom:24px;

line-height:1.7;

font-size:14px;
}

.guidelines h4{
color:#ffcc00;
font-size:18px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* FORM ELEMENTS */
/* ===================================== */

select,
textarea{

width:100%;

padding:14px;

border:none;

border-radius:14px;

outline:none;

margin-bottom:18px;

font-size:14px;
}

textarea{
height:180px;
resize:none;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* CHECKBOX */
/* ===================================== */

.checkbox-box{
margin-bottom:22px;
font-size:14px;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* INFO BOXES */
/* ===================================== */

.info-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:18px;
margin-top:28px;
}

.info-card{

background:
rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

padding:20px;

border-radius:18px;

line-height:1.7;
}

.info-card h4{
font-size:18px;
margin-bottom:10px;
color:#ffcc00;
}

/* ===================================== */
/* MOBILE */
/* ===================================== */

@media(max-width:992px){

.page-title{
font-size:28px;
}

body{
padding:18px;
}

.form-box{
padding:22px;
}

.info-grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

}

</style>

</head>
<body>

<!-- ===================================== -->
<!-- TOP BAR -->
<!-- ===================================== -->

<div class="top-bar">

<h1 class="page-title">
🙏 Prayer Requests
</h1>

<a href="/dashboard" class="back-btn">
← Dashboard
</a>

</div>

<!-- ===================================== -->
<!-- PRAYER NAVIGATION -->
<!-- ===================================== -->

<div class="prayer-nav">

<a
href="/user/community-prayers"
class="nav-btn"
>
🤝 Community Prayers
</a>

<a
href="/user/my-prayers"
class="nav-btn"
>
📋 My Prayers
</a>

</div>

<!-- ===================================== -->
<!-- FORM BOX -->
<!-- ===================================== -->

<div class="form-box">

<!-- DESCRIPTION -->

<div class="form-description">

Share your prayer intentions with the church community.
Your request may inspire support, encouragement, and collective prayer from fellow youth members and leaders.

</div>

<!-- GUIDELINES -->

<div class="guidelines">

<h4>
📖 Prayer Guidelines
</h4>

• Keep your prayer request respectful and sincere.<br>
• Avoid inappropriate or offensive language.<br>
• Anonymous prayers are allowed for sensitive concerns.<br>
• The community can support and pray for your request.<br>
• Testimonies can be shared once prayers are answered.

</div>

<!-- FORM -->

<form
action="/user/create-prayer-request"
method="POST"
>

<select
name="category"
required
>

<option value="">
Select Prayer Category
</option>

<option value="Healing">
Healing
</option>

<option value="Family">
Family
</option>

<option value="Studies">
Studies
</option>

<option value="Financial">
Financial
</option>

<option value="Thanksgiving">
Thanksgiving
</option>

<option value="Guidance">
Guidance
</option>

<option value="Ministry">
Ministry
</option>

<option value="Personal">
Personal
</option>

</select>

<textarea
name="prayer"
placeholder="Type your prayer request here..."
required
></textarea>

<div class="checkbox-box">

<input
type="checkbox"
name="anonymous"
value="YES"
>

<label>
Submit as Anonymous
</label>

</div>

<button
type="submit"
class="submit-btn"
>
🙏 Submit Prayer Request
</button>

</form>

<!-- INFO CARDS -->

<div class="info-grid">

<div class="info-card">

<h4>
🙏 Prayer Support
</h4>

Members of the youth ministry can support and pray for your requests together as one Christ-centered community.

</div>

<div class="info-card">

<h4>
✨ Answered Prayers
</h4>

Users may mark prayers as answered and share testimonies that can inspire and encourage others.

</div>

<div class="info-card">

<h4>
🤝 Community Faith
</h4>

Prayer requests strengthen unity, faith, encouragement, and spiritual connection among youth members.

</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>